+Use case: precise-object-edit. Asset type: production master app icon. Reconstruct ONLY the large burgundy icon artwork on the LEFT of the attached reference preview as a high-resolution 2048 by 2048 pixel square. This is a faithful reference-guided high-resolution reconstruction of selected ODA icon 8, NOT a new logo concept. Remove all the surrounding white page, phone, text, labels and mockup. Treat the large left icon as the edit target. Copy its composition, perspective, positions, relative scale, orientation, materials and lighting as closely as possible.
+The artwork contains EXACTLY THREE thick polished rectangular domino-shaped pieces with rounded edges, all blank with NO dots, markings or lettering: the front piece is reflective warm yellow-gold metal, leaning diagonally to the LEFT, its top reaching near the upper center and its bottom toward the lower-left. Its broad front face is bright buttery gold with controlled specular highlights, the thick narrow RIGHT side is darker metallic gold. Behind it are two UPRIGHT glossy deep ruby/burgundy red pieces stepping back toward the right: the nearer center red piece partially occluded by the gold, the farthest red piece on the right slightly higher. Preserve their narrow bright red reflective right edges and very dark wine-red broad faces. Three pieces total, no duplicate extra gold tile. Broad faces have the same softly beveled border edges as the reference. Objects rest on the burgundy floor with soft grounded dark shadows, not floating. Maintain the original amount of spacing and the large foreground gold tile relative to the two red tiles. The object group's silhouette and framing must be closely matched to the large left reference.
+Critical output requirement: the entire output is ONE edge-to-edge opaque deep burgundy square scene, matching the icon's burgundy background, including all four corners. Do NOT reproduce the original icon's rounded outer mask or the white page beyond it: continue the burgundy background naturally into square corners so iOS/PWA can apply its own corner mask later. No frame, no outline around the image, no phone, no mockup, no typography, no watermark, no pips. Crisp premium 3D product render, faithful to the source with clean highlights and no additional decoration. Output 2048x2048 if possible, at least 1024x1024.
